---
title: Carrot and Tomato Soup
tags:
  - carrot
  - tomato
  - vegetarian
  - under-30-minutes
description: A simple, warming soup made with carrots, tomatoes, and vegetable broth.
ingredients:
  - 4 carrots, peeled and chopped
  - 1 small onion, diced
  - 1 can (400 g) chopped tomatoes
  - 3 cups vegetable broth
  - 1 tablespoon olive oil
  - Salt and black pepper
duration: 30
---

## Preparation

1. Warm the olive oil in a pot over medium heat. Add the onion and cook until soft.
2. Add the carrots, chopped tomatoes, and vegetable broth. Bring to a boil, then simmer for about 20 minutes, until the carrots are tender.
3. Blend until smooth, season with salt and pepper, and serve warm.